if you're not satiated you can always eat safely.

when eating, if you get the message about having a hard time getting
it all down, consider that a warning to the effect that another bite
could kill.

if already satiated, under some conditions you can eat and you'll be
asked if you want to stop. the sane thing to do is answer "yes" but
you can occasionally answer "no" and survive.

if you eat immediately after getting the hard time message you won't
be given an oppurtunity to stop since the first bite chokes you.

